# F1 FlashPoint – Project Tech Stack

This document defines the technologies, dependencies, APIs, and architectural tools required to build and operate F1 FlashPoint. The primary goal is to provide AI coding models with an accurate and current technical scaffold, optimized for clarity, composability, and straightforward development. The project is Python-first.

---

## 🧠 Core Language
- **Python 3.11+**
  - Typing-aware, async-friendly, LLM-compatible foundation
  - [https://www.python.org/downloads/](https://www.python.org/downloads/)

---

## 🔧 Backend Frameworks
- **FastAPI**
  - For API services, admin dashboard, trigger endpoints
  - Async, auto-docs via Swagger
  - [https://fastapi.tiangolo.com](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com)

- **Uvicorn**
  - ASGI server for FastAPI
  - [https://www.uvicorn.org](https://www.uvicorn.org)

---

## 📡 Data & Analytics
- **FastF1**
  - Official F1 data extractor (session/lap data, telemetry, weather)
  - [https://github.com/theOehrly/Fast-F1](https://github.com/theOehrly/Fast-F1)
  - Compatible with modern pandas + numpy

- **Pandas / NumPy**
  - Data manipulation and matrix ops
  - [https://pandas.pydata.org](https://pandas.pydata.org)
  - [https://numpy.org](https://numpy.org)

- **Cachetools** (optional)
  - For local insight caching (in-memory or disk-backed)
  - [https://cachetools.readthedocs.io](https://cachetools.readthedocs.io)

---

## ✍️ LLMs & Copy Generation
- **OpenRouter API** (for GPT-4, Claude, Mistral, Sonnet, etc.)
  - Unified access to multiple LLMs
  - [https://openrouter.ai/docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs)

- **Promptlayer SDK** (optional)
  - For prompt logging/debugging
  - [https://docs.promptlayer.com](https://docs.promptlayer.com)

- **tiktoken**
  - For token estimation and prompt window optimization
  - [https://github.com/openai/tiktoken](https://github.com/openai/tiktoken)

---

## 🎨 Media Generation
- **OpenAI Image API (DALL·E 3)**
  - [https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/images](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/images)

- **Stability AI SDK** (Stable Diffusion XL)
  - [https://platform.stability.ai/docs](https://platform.stability.ai/docs)

- **RunwayML API** *(optional)*
  - For stylized video clips or AI video-to-video generation
  - [https://docs.runwayml.com](https://docs.runwayml.com)

- **Pillow / OpenCV**
  - For post-processing, resizing, compositing
  - [https://pillow.readthedocs.io](https://pillow.readthedocs.io)
  - [https://docs.opencv.org](https://docs.opencv.org)

- **MoviePy**
  - Timeline-based video assembly
  - [https://zulko.github.io/moviepy](https://zulko.github.io/moviepy)

- **FFmpeg (via subprocess)**
  - Final encoding, compression, and format conversion
  - [https://ffmpeg.org](https://ffmpeg.org)

---

## 📲 Instagram Posting
- **Facebook Graph API – Instagram Content Publishing**
  - Used for scheduling and posting Reels
  - Auth via Facebook Login + Business Account setup
  - [https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram-api](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram-api)

- **Requests / HTTPX**
  - Simple REST interaction with Facebook API
  - [https://docs.python-requests.org](https://docs.python-requests.org)
  - [https://www.python-httpx.org](https://www.python-httpx.org)

---

## 🖥️ Admin Dashboard (Lightweight UI)
- **FastAPI + Jinja2 Templates**
  - For quick web-based controls (manual trigger, post preview, error logs)
  - Minimal JavaScript footprint

