## Versioning & Package Management
- **Poetry** (preferred) or pip + requirements.txt
  - [https://python-poetry.org](https://python-poetry.org)

---

## Optional/Experimental
- **LangChain / LlamaIndex**
  - For chaining or document-indexing insights (optional)

- **Gradio / Streamlit**
  - For future visual debugging or prompt-tweaking interfaces

---

## Design Principles
- Python-native whenever possible
- No premature abstractions or over-engineering
- Prioritize clarity over protection
- All components should work locally with minimal setup
- Defaults should be intelligent but overrideable

